WEBVTT

00:07:28.236 --> 00:07:32.996
And as the wise ram tells Po
in “Kung Fu Panda 2,”

00:07:33.036 --> 00:07:37.036
"Your story may not have
such a happy beginning,

00:07:37.076 --> 00:07:39.516
but that does not make you who you are.

00:07:39.556 --> 00:07:41.356
It is the rest of it,

00:07:41.356 --> 00:07:43.236
who you choose to be."

00:07:43.236 --> 00:07:44.636
Right now,

00:07:44.636 --> 00:07:48.796
survival is victory in this story
that we are living.

00:07:48.836 --> 00:07:50.836
We are alive during a pandemic.

00:07:50.876 --> 00:07:52.036
We are winning.

00:07:52.076 --> 00:07:54.036
And just for that, we should be grateful.

00:07:54.436 --> 00:07:57.956
And I hope the choices we make
in these challenging times will,

00:07:57.956 --> 00:07:59.196
Inshallah, God willing,

00:07:59.196 --> 00:08:01.596
lead to a better story for all of us.